1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
HOMEZ V6.5 troubleshooting and safe use guide.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:50,000
A wrong username or password shows this screen.
It never reveals which field was wrong.

3
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:40,000
Admin badges are all green; manager accounts
show three in red. Not an error — a permission limit.

4
00:01:40,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Seeing this on an admin-only screen? Sign in as
admin or ask one to grant access.

5
00:02:20,000 --> 00:03:20,000
401 login error, 403 insufficient permission,
423 migration restricted mode, 429 API rate limit.

6
00:03:20,000 --> 00:04:10,000
Never capture invite codes. Remember Fake Provider
screens. Coming-soon menus are safe. Only admins approve migrations.

7
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:40,000
Attach the diagnostics export output when
contacting support for faster diagnosis.

8
00:04:40,000 --> 00:05:00,000
That concludes all five HOMEZ V6.5 guides.
